mini fleet-sign: DREGG_NODE_URL is set and not read (Bread's signer used it; Mini's profile, socket and fee come from --profile/MINI_PROFILE, the profile's pinned Host and the pinned tariff)
mini fleet-sign: DREGG_API_TOKEN is set and not read (Bread's signer used it; Mini's profile, socket and fee come from --profile/MINI_PROFILE, the profile's pinned Host and the pinned tariff)
mini fleet-sign: DREGG_COORDINATION_EXEMPT is set and not read (Bread's signer used it; Mini's profile, socket and fee come from --profile/MINI_PROFILE, the profile's pinned Host and the pinned tariff)
mini fleet-sign: DREGG_PROFILE is set and not read (Bread's signer used it; Mini's profile, socket and fee come from --profile/MINI_PROFILE, the profile's pinned Host and the pinned tariff)
mini: --fund on transfer: Mini has no faucet; the source must already hold amount + fee
